          "request": {
            "name": "Amazon Config Delete Conformance Pack",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Deletes the specified conformance pack and all the Config rules, remediation actions, and all evaluation results within that conformance pack.</p> <p>Config sets the conformance pack to <code>DELETE_IN_PROGRESS</code> until the deletion is complete. You cannot update a conformance pack while it is in this state.</p>",
